<br>
<BR>

<HR><BR>
<FONT SIZE=+2><B><FONT COLOR="#FF0000">Monsie Info:</FONT></B> <BR><BR></FONT>
<pre>
        
s = strangulation

Cubic man              9k    none
Dwelf                 100    none
Gardener              200    none
Huge war troll         4k    2 sceptres
Ice cube               1k    none
Mudman                 3k    none
Newbie child           2k    none
Newbie Cook            6k    random weapon
Newbie guard           1k    random weapon, key into the fortress
Newbie King       s    8k    newbie king's crown, steel short spear, newbie king's key
Newbie wife            2k    none
